flowchart TD
    guest[WASM guest module - nx-sdk]
    subgraph core[nx-core runtime]
        engine[Wasmtime engine and WASI preview1]
        host[Host API - namespace nx]
        sync[SyncManager - apply, replication, storage, migration]
        engine --> host
        host --> sync
    end
    store[nx-store - local sled datastore]
    crdt[nx-sync - CRDT and operation types]
    net[nx-net - TCP, TLS, peer protocol]
    peers[Connected peer nodes]
    guest -->|Host API calls| host
    host -->|Local KV access| store
    sync -->|CRDT persistence| store
    sync -->|Uses CRDT logic| crdt
    sync -->|Replication and repair| net
    net <-->|Direct broadcast and bounded anti-entropy| peers
